This product includes software developed by the credit-card-sys-ops
contributors. It is an LLM-agent operations and diagnosis framework for a
credit-card transaction stack: the framework exposes three comparable tool-face
schemes — a knowledge-graph scheme backed by Neo4j, an ontology scheme backed by
RDF triples and SHACL shapes served through GraphDB, and a variant of the
knowledge-graph scheme — over a shared offline gate registry and evidence-file
contracts. The repository as published is the offline-verifiable part of that
framework.

